  ["Purchase any of the following <Highlight_Yellow> gift packs </> to claim the first-purchase gift"] = "Compre qualquer um dos seguintes <Highlight_Yellow> pacotes de presente </> para resgatar o presente de primeira compra",
  ["Purchase to upgrade the <Highlight>Gift of Fate</> Deluxe Edition to the Collector's Edition. You will receive all rewards from the Deluxe Edition, instantly increase your level by 15, and immediately receive additional rich rewards such as Holy Grail (Bound), bound Gold Pounds, and Transmutation Crystals."] = "Compre para atualizar o <Highlight> Gift of Fate </> Deluxe Edition para a Collector's Edition. Você receberá todas as recompensas da Edição Deluxe, aumentará instantaneamente seu nível em 15 e receberá imediatamente recompensas valiosas adicionais, como Santo Graal (Bound), Libras de Ouro vinculadas e Cristais de Transmutação.",
  ["Purchase to receive the following items: <Highlight>Silver Baboon Backpack</>, <Highlight>Social: Dribble</>, <Highlight>Title: Friend of Baboons</>, and 1 <Highlight>Vitality Sugar Cube</>."] = "Compre para receber os seguintes itens: <Highlight> Mochila Babuíno Prateado </> , <Highlight> Social: Drible </> , <Highlight> Título: Amigo dos Babuínos </> e 1 <Highlight> Cubo de Açúcar Vitality </>.",
  ["Purchase to receive the following items: Hairstyle: <Highlight>Natural Softness</>, Accessory: <Highlight>Mysterious Hardcover Notebook</>, Idle Animation: <Highlight>Praise the Fool</>, and 1 <Highlight>Vitality Sugar Cube</>."] = "Compre para receber os seguintes itens: Penteado: <Highlight> Suavidade Natural </>, Acessório: <Highlight> Caderno de capa dura misterioso </>, Animação ociosa: <Highlight> Praise the Fool </> e 1 <Highlight> Vitality Sugar Cube </>.",
  ["Purchase to receive the following items: Outfit: <Highlight>In the Evening Breeze</> and <Highlight>1 Vitality Sugar Cube</>."] = "Compre para receber os seguintes itens: Traje: <Highlight> In the Evening Breeze </> e <Highlight> 1 Vitality Sugar Cube </> .",
  ["Purchase to unlock the <Highlight>Gift of Fate</> Collector's Edition. You will receive all rewards from the Deluxe Edition, instantly increase your level by 15, and immediately receive additional rich rewards such as Holy Grail (Bound), bound Gold Pounds, and Transmutation Crystals."] = "Compre para desbloquear a <Highlight> Gift of Fate </> Collector's Edition. Você receberá todas as recompensas da Edição Deluxe, aumentará instantaneamente seu nível em 15 e receberá imediatamente recompensas valiosas adicionais, como Santo Graal (Bound), Libras de Ouro vinculadas e Cristais de Transmutação.",
  ["Purchase to unlock the <Highlight>Gift of Fate</> Deluxe Edition. You will receive privileges such as increased invoice acquisition efficiency and increased inventory capacity, and you can also claim rich rewards like limited outfits, limited accessories, Holy Grail (Bound), and dyeing materials as you level up."] = "Compre para desbloquear a <Highlight> Gift of Fate </> Deluxe Edition. Você receberá privilégios como maior eficiência na aquisição de faturas e maior capacidade de estoque, e também poderá reivindicar recompensas valiosas, como roupas limitadas, acessórios limitados, Santo Graal (Bound) e materiais de tingimento conforme você sobe de nível.",
